values ('0fcd17a4-299e-4844-a5ac-5d8d89b1e002', 'calm-hands', 'Calm Hands Massage', 'Massage & bodywork in the heart of Copenhagen', 'Therapeutic and relaxing massage by certified therapists. Deep tissue, sports, pregnancy and hot stone – book online, by phone or just ask our AI receptionist.', 'massage', '💆', '#3fcfab', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544161515-4ab6ce6db874?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=70', 'Østerbrogade 64', '2100 Copenhagen Ø', '+45 XX XX XX XX', 'hello@calmhands.demo', 'Street parking (zone 2) on the side streets. Bus 1A and 14 stop right outside.', 'Massage by our certified therapists is covered by ''Sygeforsikringen danmark'' (groups 1, 2 and 5) and by many workplace health insurances. Bring your membership card – we give you an invoice you can submit.', 'https://www.google.com/search?q=Calm+Hands+Massage+reviews')
